
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Floran Navy.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Floran Navy.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1ka2cmz","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481304,"size":3515,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"1ka2cmz"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,29],"#Culture - The Floran Navy":[31,32],"#The powerful and increasingly independent naval force of Flora.":[33,48],"#The powerful and increasingly independent naval force of Flora.#{1}":[34,48]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["navy","fleet","naval","warship","portsmouth","mutiny"],"refine_keys":["navy","naval","fleet","ship","sailor","admiral","sea"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Floran Navy:** The national naval force of Flora, an unofficial third political power alongside the Crown and the Matriarchs. It operates with significant autonomy, possessing its own agenda, funding mechanisms (pillaging, trade escorts), and secret alliances (e.g., with a Pradeshi pirate king). Historically expanded via press-ganging (The Expansion), leading to mutinies, but modern reforms prioritize crew welfare and conflict management to ensure loyalty. Not all Floran warships are Royal Navy; coastal counties have private flotillas, and state-sanctioned privateers (e.g., Lady Francisca Blake) also operate.\n\n**Select when:** The context involves Floran military strategy, naval power projection, piracy, political tension between the Crown/Matriarchs, military funding, mutiny, or the military's relationship with the Skaagi or Pradeshi. Also relevant when discussing private fleets or privateers acting in Flora's name.\n\n**Key Relationships:** Subordinate to Crown, funded/budgeted by Matriarchs (but defies both in practice). Maintains secret pact with Pradeshi pirate king. Expanded after Skaagi occupation of Pradesh. Counts private flotillas and state-sanctioned privateers as separate but related forces."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Floran Navy.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1gv93ck","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Floran Navy.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,29],"size":1554,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
